<title>FINLAND: RAUTAKIRJA SEES STEADY 1997 OP PROFIT.</title>
<headline>RAUTAKIRJA SEES STEADY 1997 OP PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailing group Rautakirja Oy said in a statement on Thursday it expected full-year 1997 operating earnings to reach the same level as in 1996, when operating profit was 198 million markka or 6.1 percent of net sales.</p>
</text>
